        "text_FMPWPH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>At Rebel Nell, we believe in turning barriers into opportunities. Named after trailblazer <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\">Eleanor Roosevelt</a>, we empower women facing barriers to employment by providing equitable opportunities, wraparound support, and a pathway to self-sufficiency.<br/><br/>We repurpose Detroit’s fallen graffiti and meaningful materials into One Of No Other Kind jewelry and accessories, ensuring that each piece is as unique as the woman who made it. More than art, every piece carries a piece of Detroit history—a testament to resilience, creativity, and community.<br/><br/>When you wear Rebel Nell, you’re not just making a statement—you’re making a difference.</p>"
          }
